Spec: "announcements are queued (at most 1 pending, minimum 2 s interval)". So at any point: at most 1 announcement pending (in-flight or waiting); minimum 2 s between announcements. Design:

- `announce(message, priority, now)`:
  - If there's no pending and now - lastAnnounced >= 2000 → announce immediately: lastAnnounced = now; return message (the LiveRegion displays it).
